B.a1w=s(["Connect a Bluetooth numpad to enter scores with physical keys (also works in PC browsers)","Keys 1\u20139 \u2192 pin number, Key 0 \u2192 miss","* key \u2192 10, \u2212 key \u2192 11, + key \u2192 12","Backspace \u2192 same as Undo","Press Enter to confirm when a dialog is open",'After the final result dialog, tap "Edit Scores" to undo the last throw and fix mistakes'],t.s)
